  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed externally illuminated projecting sign, non illuminated fascia lettering and advertising awning, by reason of the method of illumination of the projecting sign and the design, size, siting and materials of all additions, would result in harmful visual clutter, detracting from the visual amenity of the Grade II listed host building, the wider listed terrace (nos.1, 3 and 5) and cause harm to the character and appearance of the wider Bloomsbury Conservation Area. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies D1 (Design), D2 (Heritage), D3 (Shopfronts) and D4 (Advertisements) of the Camden Local Plan 2017. "
